<title>JAPAN: Shizuoka Subaru -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shizuoka Subaru -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.61		vs	    9.72</p>
<p> Operating	  369    million	  vs	  236    million</p>
<p> Current	    366    million	  vs	  229    million</p>
<p> Net		  242    million	  vs	  135    million</p>
<p> EPS		   39.75 yen	  vs	   24.68 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Shizuoka Subaru Motor Co Ltd is a Subaru automobile dealer linked to Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd.</p>
